{"3820870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gridpaper", "steam_appid": 3820870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHOOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every shot is a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Miss, and you'll feel it immediately. Hit a headshot, and you're rewarded with informatica... the currency that makes you faster and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The more you can make each bullet count, the more you will be rewarded.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SMASH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A wrench is not a backup weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crush enemies into informatic dust, launch yourself through combat, and turn close-range encounters into opportunities instead of mistakes.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gravity is just another weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drive yourself into the ground and release devastating shockwaves that clear entire groups of enemies in an instant.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHIELD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why dodge a projectile when you can own it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deflect incoming attacks, deny enemy fire, and turn their aggression back against them with perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The safest place on the battlefield is often directly inside the chaos. <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SPEED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game has bunny hopping... and... it can get kind of crazy.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every surface is an opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive beneath enemy fire, reposition instantly, and maintain momentum while threading through narrow spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...or do just do it to look cool.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SPRINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no speed limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Accelerate beyond reason, race through handcrafted levels, and compete against players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Someone already has the record. Take it from them. (It's probably Geetar, tbh)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SCULPT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build the Geometer you wish you were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mix hardware and software upgrades across every limb, discover powerful combinations, and create a play-style that is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Soar to the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete for world records, climb global rankings, and earn recognition reserved for the fastest players alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I send merch to the top players each month. &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Precision-Driven Gunplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Momentum-Based Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Airborne Combat System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Devastating Ground Slams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Projectile Blocking &amp; Deflection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Skill-Based Melee Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Sprinting, Sliding &amp; Bunny Hopping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Global Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Community Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Deep Upgrade Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Hardware &amp; Software Augments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multiple Playstyle Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Numerous Official Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Map Editor &amp; Community Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Speedrun-Oriented Level Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Replayable Mission Structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Abstract Mathematical World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Diverse Enemy Roster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Real, Tangible Prizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Ongoing Community-Driven Development</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHOOT</strong></p><p class=\